    {
      "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40},
      "id": 14,
      "options": {"content": "# Implementation Status\n\nThis section is reserved for the first controlled baseline-vs-modified Telnet experiment.\n\nAvailable now:\n- completed-session duration histogram\n- early-disconnect ratio, provisional\n- bounded protocol actions\n- measurement-reliability checks\n\nStill required:\n- approved modified behavior\n- bounded experiment identity or separate run configuration\n- repeatable baseline and modified traffic runs\n- agreed comparison and defender-cost criteria\n\nNo comparison panel is shown until those inputs exist, preventing empty or misleading PromQL.\n\n```text\nBaseline vs Modified\n|-- p50 / p95 duration\n|-- Early disconnect\n|-- Interaction depth\n`-- Defender cost\n```", "mode": "markdown"},
      "title": "Implementation Status",
      "type": "text"
    }
